We believe that independent investigation is crucial for understanding and managing misalignment risk. This project is an important step in that direction; we&#x27;re excited to work on it.</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-500 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-100/50" data-href="/METR_Evals/status/2097765966088487290" role="link" tabindex="0"><article><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 p-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1"><a class="" href="/METR_Evals"><div class="shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-300 rounded-xs size-6 transition duration-200 hover:brightness-90"><img alt="@METR_Evals" class="size-full object-cover" draggable="false" loading="lazy" sizes="24px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2021827383431757824/AeVvT0rU_normal.jpg" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2021827383431757824/AeVvT0rU_mini.jpg 24w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2021827383431757824/AeVvT0rU_normal.jpg 48w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2021827383431757824/AeVvT0rU_bigger.jpg 73w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2021827383431757824/AeVvT0rU_x96.jpg 96w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2021827383431757824/AeVvT0rU_reasonably_small.jpg 128w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2021827383431757824/AeVvT0rU_200x200.jpg 200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2021827383431757824/AeVvT0rU_400x400.jpg 400w"/></div></a><div class="shrink flex items-center text-gray-700 [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:content-[&#x27;·&#x27;] [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:px-1 [&amp;&gt;span:not(:empty)~span:not(:empty)]:before:shrink-0 min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><span class="contents"><div class="overflow-hidden flex items-center gap-1 min-w-0"><div class="flex max-w-full shrink-0 items-cen